    "description": "KOSAIDO Holdings Co., Ltd. operates as a printing company in Japan. The company offers printing, IT and digital solutions, and IT services; campaign, D2C business, and digital promotion support; and business process outsourcing services. It also involved in operation of crematoriums and funeral falls; provision of planning for funeral services, including wakes and farewell services; estate planning services; financial services, such as inheritance tax returns; real estate sales and purchases, loans, and asset management. In addition, the company provides HR services comprising HR media, HR media agency, environmental information magazine publication, and newspaper rack agency; HR tech services; and temporary staffing, recruitment, HR development, education, training, recruitment process outsourcing, and foreign HR services. The company was formerly known as Kosaido Co., Ltd. and changed its name to KOSAIDO Holdings Co., Ltd. in October 2021. The company was founded in 1949 and is based in Tokyo, Japan."
